[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0474","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0474.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0922","title":"CGIScript.net csNews 双重URL编码未授权管理访问漏洞","description":"CGIScript.net csNews 1.0 的 csNews.cgi 存在双重 URL 编码绕过漏洞。由于程序对用户输入的 URL 参数仅做单次解码校验，攻击者可利用双重 URL 编码（如将 `.` 编码为 `%2e` 再编码为 `%252e`）绕过访问控制。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 请求直接访问 `default%2edb` 或 `default%2edb.style` 等数据库文件，导致敏感信息泄露；已认证用户还可通过将 database 参数设置为 `default%2edb` 执行管理操作。该漏洞影响 CGIScript.net csNews 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0922"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:23Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 csNews 1.0，该软件已停止维护多年。建议迁移至现代新闻管理系统（如 WordPress 或 Joomla）。如无法立即替换，可采取以下临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中禁止对 csNews.cgi 的 `database` 参数传递包含 `%2e` 的请求，添加重写规则拦截 `command=manage` 或 `command=showadv` 等管理操作；同时将 csNews.cgi 文件权限设置为 750，仅允许 Web 服务器运行用户执行，禁止外部直接访问数据库文件（`*.db`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0091.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9332.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9333.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4991","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4993","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21532","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0922.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0922.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0922","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0922.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0922.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/afea9e4d3a1176ab218afc5d6d560a6f135838c1/2002/CVE-2002-0922.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0922.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0922.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0922.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-0922.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0474.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0473","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0473.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0919","title":"CGIScript.net csPassword.cgi 1.0 HTAccess 文件泄漏漏洞","description":"CGIScript.net 开发的 csPassword.cgi 1.0 版本存在输入验证漏洞，远程认证用户可通过在编辑页面的标题字段中注入换行符，绕过输入限制修改服务器上的 .htaccess 文件，从而提升权限获取对敏感资源的未授权访问。攻击者只需拥有普通用户权限即可利用该漏洞，无需其他特殊条件。该漏洞影响 csPassword.cgi 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，建议用户升级至最新版本或对用户输入进行严格过滤。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0919"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:23Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 csPassword.cgi 1.0，该脚本已不再维护。在 csPassword.cgi 的 title 字段处理逻辑中，对用户输入进行严格过滤，移除换行符（\\n 和 \\r）及特殊字符，防止通过换行符注入修改 .htaccess 文件。同时将 .htaccess 文件权限设置为 644 并禁止 CGI 用户写入，在 Web 服务器配置中限制对 .htaccess 文件的直接访问。建议迁移至其他仍在维护的密码管理 CGI 脚本或使用现代 Web 应用替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/274727","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9222.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4888","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21494","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0919.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0919.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cv