Nullsoft SHOUTcast 1.8.9 及 1.8.12 之前版本存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。经过身份验证的远程 DJ 用户可通过向服务器发送包含超长值的 icy- 开头头部字段，触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。攻击者需拥有 DJ 权限，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0907"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:22Z","remediation":"升级 Nullsoft SHOUTcast 至 1.8.12 或更高版本，该版本修复了 icy- 头部处理中的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可在服务器防火墙限制仅允许受信任 IP 连接 SHOUTcast 管理端口，并限制 DJ 账户的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0016.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9251.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4934","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21511","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0907.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0907","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0907.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0907.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0907.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c3d516d6bc446725f6492ed800c677df20d0d39c/2002/CVE-2002-0907.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0907.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0907.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0907.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0907.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0470.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0469","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0469.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0905","title":"IBM Informix SE 7.25 sqlexec 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM Informix SE 7.25 的 sqlexec 组件存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于未对 INFORMIXDIR 环境变量长度进行有效边界检查，本地攻击者可通过设置超长 INFORMIXDIR 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，导致以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Informix SE-7.25 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0905"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:21Z","remediation":"IBM 已针对 Informix SE 7.25 发布安全补丁修复 sqlexec 缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于该版本已停止技术支持，建议升级至 IBM Informix 14.10 或更新版本。如无法升级，应立即限制本地用户对 sqlexec 二进制文件的执行权限（chmod 750 sqlexec），并通过系统审计机制监控 INFORMIXDIR 环境变量的异常长度设置，同时限制可登录系统的用户范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0270.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9219.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4891","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21497","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0905.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0905.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0905","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0905.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0905.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/74a5eea2f8e7bbf8745be52f073af8f9cdbbb080/2002/CVE-2002-0905.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0905.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0905.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0905.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0905.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0469.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0468","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0468.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0902","title":"phpBB 2.0.0 IMG标签HTML注入跨站脚本漏洞","description":"phpBB 2.0.0 的 [IMG] 标签存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者通过在 [IMG] 标签中构造包含 http:// 和双引号（\"）的恶意 URL，可绕过 phpBB 的安全检查，终止 HTML IMG 标签的 src 参数并注入任意 JavaScript 脚本。当其他用户浏览包含该恶意帖子的页面时，脚本将在其浏览器中执行，导致攻击者可以窃取会话 Cookie、伪造页面内容或执行其他恶意操作。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需在论坛帖子中插入特制的 IMG 标签即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0902"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:21Z","remediation":"升级 phpBB 至 2.0.1 或更高版本（Debian 确认修复版本为 2.0.6c-1），该版本修复了 [IMG] 标签中对用户输入的双引号过滤不严问题。如无法升级，可在 phpBB 的 bbcode 解析函数中增加对 `\"` 和 `http://` 组合模式的过滤，或禁用自定义 IMG 标签功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/274273","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9178.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4858","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21486","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0902.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0902","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0902.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0902.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/74a5eea2f8e7bbf8745be52f073af8f9cdbbb080/2002/CVE-2002-0902.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0902.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0902.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-09xx/CVE-2002-0902.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0902.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0902.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0468.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0468.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0468.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0467","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0467.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0900","title":"MIT PGP Public Key Server 搜索字符串远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MIT PGP Public Key Server 0.9.2 及 0.9.4 版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向 lookup 功能提交超长搜索字符串参数，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃（拒绝服务）并可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 pks PGP 公钥 Web 服务器 0.9.5 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。厂商已在 0.9.5 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0900"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:21Z","remediation":"立即升级到 pks 0.9.5 或更高版本；若无法升级，可应用官方补丁（http://www.rubin.ch/pgp/src/patch_buffoverflow20020525）对 kd_search.c 中 word 数组的循环拷贝增加边界检查（`i < sizeof(word)`），限制搜索字符串长度不超过缓冲区大小。临时缓解措施可在防火墙或反向代理层限制对 /pks/lookup 路径的 GET 请求参数长度不超过 256 字节。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/274107","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9171.php","http://www.rubin.ch/pgp/src/patch_buffoverflow20020525","http://www.securityfocus.