ve/opencve-kb/blob/da1453d4cae0dea874922584911158e4da10a575/2002/CVE-2002-0895.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0895.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0895.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0895.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0464.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0463","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0463.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0894","title":"NewAtlanta ServletExec ISAPI 4.1 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NewAtlanta ServletExec ISAPI 4.1 中的 JSPServlet 组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长 .jsp 文件请求，或直接向 com.newatlanta.servletexec.JSP10Servlet 发送超长 URL，触发服务器崩溃，导致服务不可用。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响运行 ServletExec ISAPI 4.1 的 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0894"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:20Z","remediation":"升级 ServletExec ISAPI 至 4.1 以上版本（如 5.0），或安装厂商提供的安全补丁。若无法升级，在 web.xml 中移除或限制 com.newatlanta.servletexec.JSP10Servlet 的访问映射，并在 Web 服务器（IIS）层面限制 URL 长度不超过 4096 字节，同时配置 ISAPI 筛选器仅允许可信来源的请求。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Tomcat 或 Jetty 等仍在支持的 Java Servlet 容器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0077.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/273615","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9141.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4796","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21471","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0894.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0894.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0894","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0894.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0894.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/da1453d4cae0dea874922584911158e4da10a575/2002/CVE-2002-0894.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0894.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0894.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0894.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0894.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0463.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0463.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0463.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0462","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0462.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0893","title":"NewAtlanta ServletExec/ISAPI 4.1 目录遍历漏洞","description":"NewAtlanta ServletExec/ISAPI 4.1 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 com.newatlanta.servletexec.JSP10Servlet 发送包含 \"..%5c\"（URL 编码的路径穿越序列）的特制请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 ServletExec ISAPI 4.1 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。目前已公开利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0893"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:20Z","remediation":"升级到 NewAtlanta ServletExec 5.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在 IIS 中使用 URLScan 工具拦截包含 `..%5c` 的请求路径，或在 IIS ISAPI 筛选器层面添加规则，拒绝访问 `/com.newatlanta.servletexec.JSP10Servlet/` 路径下的目录遍历请求。