atlanta.servletexec.JSP10Servlet 发送不包含文件名的直接请求，服务器会在返回的错误信息中泄露 Web 根目录的完整物理路径。该漏洞可被攻击者利用来收集目标系统的目录结构信息，为进一步攻击（如 LFI、文件遍历）提供侦察基础。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0892"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:20Z","remediation":"升级到 ServletExec ISAPI 4.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了未指定文件名时泄露物理路径的问题。如无法升级，可在 web.xml 中禁用 JSP10Servlet 的目录浏览功能，或在应用服务器前端配置 WAF 规则拦截对 com.newatlanta.servletexec.JSP10Servlet 的直接请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q2/0077.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/273615","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9139.php","http://www.newatlanta.com/do/findFaq?faq_id=151","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4793","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21469","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0892.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0892.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0892","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0892.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0892.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a8d9b19e8bcb98a5a7dedc851836a009f19fbc3e/2002/CVE-2002-0892.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0892.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0892.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0892.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea98